'' '#if typeof( T )' THROUGH NAMESPACES: the text is the qualified name ('N1.T'), a bare T is found
'' in the current namespace, then the enclosing ones, then the usings, and 'N2.T' follows N2's own
'' usings (fbc's namespace/ns-using*.bas, using-types.bas). Expected output is fbc-modern's.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/pp-typeof-namespaces.bas -o tests/codegen/pptypeofnamespaces.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=toolchains/tiko-windows/lib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/codegen/pptypeofnamespaces.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: a - c d e - g h i 
